# Current main has no effective Web .env contract.
#
# web/src/supabase.ts still uses checked-in public constants. Setting the old
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, or R2_WORKER_URL names here has no effect.
# Do not place real values in this file or rely on it for deployment.
#
# The deployment-isolation task must introduce Camp-specific Vite variables,
# update the source to read them, and then replace this notice with a usable
# value-free template.
#
# DISABLE_HMR is an optional shell variable read by vite.config.ts. Set it in
# the process that starts Vite; it is not a browser runtime variable.
